<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-062" chapter-id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun" source-id="s-jinshu-062-liuqun-ws2629226">
  <p id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p001:m0000" ref="b21_e55_8bd_A">群</persName>字公度，少拜廣武侯世子。隨父在晉陽，遭逢寇亂，數領偏軍征討。性清慎，有裁斷，得士類歡心。及<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p001:m0046" ref="b21_e55_8bd">琨</persName>爲<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p001:m0048" ref="1y3_yi0_8d4">匹磾</persName>所害，<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p001:m0053" ref="b21_e55_8bd">琨</persName>從事中郎<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p001:m0058" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA">盧諶</persName>等率餘眾奉<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p001:m0065" ref="b21_e55_8bd_A">群</persName>依<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p001:m0067" ref="92h_q40_d2s">末波</persName>。<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p001:m0070" ref="6v8_pk9_7k5">溫嶠</persName>前後表稱：「姨弟<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p001:m0080" ref="b21_e55_8bd_A">劉群</persName>，內弟<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p001:m0085" ref="c2c_bkm_zon">崔悅</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p001:m0088" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA">盧諶</persName>等，皆在<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p001:m0094" ref="92h_q40_d2s">末波</persName>中，翹首南望。愚謂此等並有文思，於人之中少可湣惜。如蒙錄召，繼絕興亡，則陛下更生之恩，望古無二。」咸康二年，<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p001:m0150" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAAA">成帝</persName>詔徵<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p001:m0154" ref="b21_e55_8bd_A">群</persName>等，爲<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p001:m0158" ref="92h_q40_d2s">末波</persName>兄弟愛其才，托以道險不遣。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p002:m0000" ref="u61_ylg_6av">石季龍</persName>滅遼西，<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p002:m0007" ref="b21_e55_8bd_A">群</persName>及<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p002:m0009" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA">諶</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p002:m0011" ref="c2c_bkm_zon">悅</persName>同沒胡中，<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p002:m0017" ref="u61_ylg_6av">季龍</persName>皆優禮之，以<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p002:m0025" ref="b21_e55_8bd_A">群</persName>爲中書令。至<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p002:m0032" ref="a2f_3ca_0b4">冉閔</persName>敗後，<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p002:m0037" ref="b21_e55_8bd_A">群</persName>遇害。時<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p002:m0042" ref="0c9_95a_18b">勒</persName>及<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p002:m0044" ref="u61_ylg_6av">季龍</persName>得公卿人士多殺之，其見擢用，終至大官者，唯有河東<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p002:m0070" ref="c6e_8f3_014">裴憲</persName>，渤海<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p002:m0075" ref="xje_96a_jh9">石璞</persName>，滎陽<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p002:m0080" ref="2i4_mj4_olr">鄭系</persName>，潁川<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p002:m0085" ref="yoo_ox0_545_FAAABB">荀綽</persName>，北地<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p002:m0090" ref="258_ae3_26e">傅暢</persName>及<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p002:m0093" ref="b21_e55_8bd_A">群</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p002:m0095" ref="c2c_bkm_zon">悅</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-062-liuqun:p002:m0097" ref="m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA">諶</persName>等十餘人而已。</p>
</text>
